<title>USA: U.S. Spring/White Wheat - Bids off slightly on MGE.</title>
<headline>U.S. Spring/White Wheat - Bids off slightly on MGE.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dark northern spring wheat cash bids were slightly lower on Tuesday in very quiet dealings as MGE spring wheat futures slipped, cash grain dealers said.</p>
<p>The Christmas holiday stalled movement and most merchants said elevators were closing early.</p>
<p>&quot;There's absolutely nothing going on today,&quot; one Montana dealer said.</p>
<p>Snow continued to fall in parts of the northern Plains but accumulations were light.</p>
<p>&quot;We've got a few flurries but it looks like most of the damage was done yesterday,&quot; a Minnesota dealer said.  </p>
